 "description": "Get one deal with its history\n\nReturns one deal with its event history, attestations and payment records; `stage`, `deadline` and `deadline_kind` say where it stands and which clock is running. Public: anyone with the id can read it. With a wallet session the answer also carries `actions` (what that wallet may do now); anonymously `actions` is null, a collab's agreed terms are removed from its events, and signatures on attestations are blanked. `terms` is never on this read; it is only on the parties' own list of their deals.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "dealId": {
    "description": "The deal's id (a UUID, as returned in `deal.id` / `dealId`).",
    "format": "uuid",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "dealId"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
